  skos:changeNote "0.2.0 (2026-10-21): Restructured to the operational areas and the naming standard (D26, D27): titled 'Domain Sales.Partner & Channel Vocabulary', '… Taxonomy', '… Ontology' and '… Shapes', at …/<kind>/domain-sales.partner-and-channel/ (formerly the Partner and channel domain, …/<kind>/domain-partner-and-channel/), now an L2 domain of Domain Sales. Built by build_domains.py from spec_sales_partner_and_channel.py against Baseline Core v1.0 (core 0.1.0)."@en ,
